<title>USA: Del Laboratories Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Del Laboratories Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>					     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales			 $61,319,000    $56,094,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			3,295,000	2,388,000</p>
<p> Earnings per common share	    0.52	     0.37</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	     6,338,000	6,500,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Earnings per share and the average shares outstanding have been adjusted to reflect a 4-for-3 stock split effective November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>Del Laboratories Inc.</p>
</text>
